WEBVTT

00:00:28.756 --> 00:00:30.476
but the social anthropologist in me

00:00:30.516 --> 00:00:33.676
hangs on to the human power
of forethought.

00:00:33.716 --> 00:00:38.316
That's our ability to predict
and prepare for what might happen.

00:00:39.316 --> 00:00:41.756
Of all the things
that make us uniquely human,

00:00:41.796 --> 00:00:44.556
forethought has got to be
one of the most interesting

00:00:44.596 --> 00:00:48.436
because it enables us
to imagine and create our futures.

00:00:49.236 --> 00:00:52.556
It gives us the ability
to be deeply creative.

00:00:53.316 --> 00:00:56.836
My next question is:
Are we living in reality?

00:00:57.916 --> 00:00:59.916
I'm not channeling my inner Morpheus here.

00:00:59.956 --> 00:01:02.876
This is honestly something
I think about a lot.